                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c0e9e62c-62ff-3f83-9be0-91e8f0cb3bf6",
                        "entry_id": "072b99a6-7d53-3225-a9e4-21093f871449",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Vermittlung der Fähigkeit zu schreiben"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "71908ff4-ad01-47e0-9a6e-15e718590521",
                                "sense_id": "c0e9e62c-62ff-3f83-9be0-91e8f0cb3bf6",
                                "text": "„Mit weitgehender Alphabetisierung ist trotz der frühen Schulpflicht in Preußen zumindest im 19. Jahrhundert ebenfalls nicht zu rechnen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7408f3c3-b3c2-4c1b-97c9-7786ca00d319",
                                "sense_id": "c0e9e62c-62ff-3f83-9be0-91e8f0cb3bf6",
                                "text": "„Die hohe Alphabetisierung der aschkenasischen Juden machte diese Gruppe zu einem lukrativen Absatzmarkt.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6796c6f0-34c9-3b89-ad9e-aa4d7aee5257",
                        "entry_id": "072b99a6-7d53-3225-a9e4-21093f871449",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Anordnung nach der Reihenfolge des Alphabets"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c8472ed5-3b09-4293-a8b2-e543fbde947e",
                                "sense_id": "6796c6f0-34c9-3b89-ad9e-aa4d7aee5257",
                                "text": "„In ebenso strenger wie verspielter Ordnungsliebe strukturieren Numerierungen und Alphabetisierungen sein Œuvre.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e6bf5453-d23e-4acf-af6b-7a1e65e23884",
                                "sense_id": "6796c6f0-34c9-3b89-ad9e-aa4d7aee5257",
                                "text": "„Wissenschaftlich gesehen bedeutet Alphabetisierung, mit Ausnahme eigentlicher Nachschlagewerke, allemal eine Notlösung, die anzeigt, daß es an einer übergeordneten, zugleich ordnenden Perspektive fehlt.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "edf4cab4-3e1e-427c-b8c7-0fedf44c89fa",
                        "source_entry_id": "072b99a6-7d53-3225-a9e4-21093f871449",
                        "source_sense_id": "c0e9e62c-62ff-3f83-9be0-91e8f0cb3bf6",
                        "source_sense_description": "Vermittlung der Fähigkeit zu schreiben",
                        "target_lang_word": "literacy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "literacy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e1e30836-f2a4-3577-805e-c33b5e9d78b9",
                                        "entry_id": "7ee7cab7-6efe-3991-88e0-f86bead1be41",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The ability to read and write."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de4964fc-4f93-41d1-b98d-c52962f52c53",
                                                "sense_id": "e1e30836-f2a4-3577-805e-c33b5e9d78b9",
                                                "text": "Himachal Pradesh Chief Minister Sukhvinder Singh Sukhu on Monday (September 8, 2025) declared Himachal as a “fully literate State” on the occasion of International Literary Day. […] Journey from 7% to 99.30%: The Chief Minister said Himachal Pradesh had reached this goal well before the scheduled timeframe, adding that the journey from minimal literacy rate of around 7% to full literacy had been full of challenges, yet the State had consistently moved forward with the aim of providing quality education. […] Mr. Sukhu said the literacy rate in Himachal Pradesh had reached 99.30%, which is higher than the national benchmark of 95% […] Union Education Secretary Sanjay Kumar, in a video message, congratulated Himachal Pradesh on this achievement and emphasised the importance of providing skill-based education to the newly literate."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2efb19d8-0286-3519-a7d1-017e2569b535",
                                        "entry_id": "7ee7cab7-6efe-3991-88e0-f86bead1be41",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The ability to understand and evaluate something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb201f50-4550-4501-a99e-ccac20fef325",
                                                "sense_id": "2efb19d8-0286-3519-a7d1-017e2569b535",
                                                "text": "computer literacy"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5470895c-380d-4a0d-ad82-39fb52ceaad7",
                                                "sense_id": "2efb19d8-0286-3519-a7d1-017e2569b535",
                                                "text": "media literacy"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de9d5daf-e85b-4eec-bc3e-907434c49ee0",
                                                "sense_id": "2efb19d8-0286-3519-a7d1-017e2569b535",
                                                "text": "Prof Alan McKee, who led the project, argues that young adults should be taught “porn literacy” to help them “read porn well” and look for healthy and ethical depictions of sex."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c109d6d1-b940-4389-b020-4796d7b73a84",
                        "source_entry_id": "072b99a6-7d53-3225-a9e4-21093f871449",
                        "source_sense_id": "c0e9e62c-62ff-3f83-9be0-91e8f0cb3bf6",
                        "source_sense_description": "Vermittlung der Fähigkeit zu schreiben",
                        "target_lang_word": "alphabétisation",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "alphabétisation",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a3af1582-3c5f-3416-9982-de19ea6ab44b",
                                        "entry_id": "582a8e95-4acb-39fb-9556-92653d71a889",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cycle d’apprentissage continu conduisant l’analphabète à l’acquisition de la lecture et de l’écriture."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "826320b7-4ddb-4069-8174-010f7ad7ac04",
                                                "sense_id": "a3af1582-3c5f-3416-9982-de19ea6ab44b",
                                                "text": "Parfois, est réputé alphabète celui qui sait lire et écrire son nom. Ces critères assez simplistes se reflètent encore parfois, de nos jours, soit dans les programmes d’alphabétisation, soit dans la détermination des dimensions du problème de l’analphabétisme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc8a1c3c-023d-4434-aaf2-220ac2951ba7",
                                                "sense_id": "a3af1582-3c5f-3416-9982-de19ea6ab44b",
                                                "text": "Des statistiques chinoises citent un taux d’alphabétisation de moins de 10 % avant 1950, alors qu’aujourd’hui, sous le régime chinois, plus de 95 % des jeunes tibétains fréquenteraient l’école primaire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc40316f-5ddb-4fc0-b446-3cebf9a839f3",
                                                "sense_id": "a3af1582-3c5f-3416-9982-de19ea6ab44b",
                                                "text": "Dès lors, puisqu’elle se constitue comme une pédagogie politique, l’alphabétisation sera synonyme de conscientisation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
